Module   demo.messy.mixed .   


Define Status as one of   Active ,  Closed .  

Define Account has   id as Text ,   balance as Int ,  status as Status .


@id("ACC-1")   
Rule   check   given   acct as Account ,  produce   Bool  :  

    // 余额检查  .
    If  acct.balance   at least  0 :
        Return   true .   
    Return false  .


